{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-11-02", "prepared_on": "2026-11-02", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-11-02</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Malicious Claude Code extension on Cursor marketplace attempts to plant SSH backdoor<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Cursor 市集出現惡意 Claude Code 擴充套件，攻擊者企圖建立 SSH 後門</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Cursor disclosed that a trojanized \"Claude Code for VS Code\" extension (versions 2.1.312 and 2.1.313) appeared on its marketplace on Oct 29, trying to install an SSH backdoor. Up to 5,000 users may be affected, and it was pulled after about 11 hours.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Cursor 公告 10 月 29 日市集上出現被植入惡意程式的 Claude Code for VS Code 擴充套件（2.1.312、2.1.313 版），企圖建立 SSH 後門，最多約 5,000 名使用者可能受影響，上架約 11 小時後下架。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180119\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Google runs an AI model on an orbiting satellite for the first time, moving toward space data centers<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 首度在太空衛星上運行 AI 模型，朝太空資料中心邁進</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google said its Project Suncatcher prototype satellites ran the Gemma 4 model in Earth orbit and produced text responses. It is the first AI inference on data-center-class TPUs in space.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 宣布「太陽捕手」計畫的原型衛星在地球軌道上成功執行 Gemma 4 並產生文字回應，這是首次在太空以資料中心等級 TPU 做 AI 推論。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180120\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Binance loses about $6.3 billion in crypto in the largest theft ever, with North Korean hackers suspected<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Binance 遭竊約 63 億美元加密貨幣，創史上最大竊案，調查指向北韓駭客</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Binance said tokens worth $6.3 billion were stolen from its wallets on Oct 29 and promised full compensation. The FBI points to North Korean hackers, and early findings suggest a compromised DevOps engineer's laptop.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Binance 公告 10 月 29 日錢包遭竊價值 63 億美元的 token，並承諾全額賠償。FBI 指北韓駭客為元兇，初步調查顯示可能源自一名 DevOps 工程師的筆電遭入侵。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180126\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Linux Foundation's AAIF adds four open-source agent projects, including Anthropic's Agent Skills<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Linux 基金會旗下 AAIF 新增 4 項 AI 代理開源專案，涵蓋沙箱隔離與技能共享</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The Agentic AI Foundation added Anthropic's Agent Skills, OpenAI's Open Responses, Hugging Face's OpenEnv and Alibaba's OpenSandbox.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Linux 基金會的代理型 AI 基金會新增 Anthropic 的 Agent Skills、OpenAI 的 Open Responses、Hugging Face 的 OpenEnv 與阿里巴巴的 OpenSandbox 四項開源專案。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180080\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Alpine Linux's GitLab hit by critical flaw, infrastructure rebuilt over supply-chain risk<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Alpine Linux 遭 GitLab 重大漏洞攻擊，重建開發基礎設施防範供應鏈風險</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Alpine Linux disclosed on Oct 28 that its GitLab server was attacked through the unpatched CVE-2026-97229 (CVSS 10.0). It shut down GitLab and is rebuilding its servers.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Alpine Linux 於 10 月 28 日揭露 GitLab 伺服器因未及時修補 CVSS 10.0 的 CVE-2026-97229 而遭攻擊，已關閉服務並重建伺服器。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180128\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Dream raises $17M seed to train world models on US building data<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">利用美國建築資料訓練世界模型的 Dream 獲得 1,700 萬美元種子輪資金</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Backed by a16z and others, Dream trains world models on over 100 million square feet of real US buildings to generate construction-ready designs.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Dream 獲 a16z 等投資，利用逾 1 億平方英尺的美國真實建築資料訓練世界模型，目標是自動產生可施工的建築圖面。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180122\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Salesforce to acquire military logistics AI startup Rune<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Salesforce 收購軍事後勤 AI 新創 Rune，將服務延伸至戰場前線</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Salesforce signed a definitive agreement to buy Rune Technologies to expand its Missionforce defense platform, with closing expected by end of January 2027.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Salesforce 簽署最終協議收購 Rune Technologies，以擴充國防業務平臺 Missionforce，預計 2027 年 1 月底前完成。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180127\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Chatbots are leading hikers astray with dangerous consequences<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">聊天機器人正誤導登山客，造成危險後果</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Outsourcing trip planning to AI can make people give up their own critical thinking, with potentially deadly results in the backcountry.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">把行程規劃交給 AI 可能讓人放棄獨立思考，在野外山區可能造成致命後果。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/chatbots-are-leading-hikers-astray-with-dangerous-consequences/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Infisical raises $40M to secure credentials and access for AI agents<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Infisical 募資 4,000 萬美元，擴展 AI 代理憑證保護與存取管理</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Infisical closed a $40M Series B at a $600M valuation and will invest more in AI agent security products.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Infisical 完成 4,000 萬美元 B 輪融資，估值 6 億美元，並將加碼投入 AI 代理安全產品。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180098\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> OpenAI might rebrand its data centers as \"AI compute campuses\"<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 可能把資料中心改稱為「AI 運算園區」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Data centers are deeply unpopular, so OpenAI may try calling them something else.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">資料中心不受歡迎，OpenAI 可能嘗試換個名稱來改善觀感。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/01/openai-might-rebrand-its-data-centers-as-ai-compute-campuses/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}